{"unit_id":"tag:04VK:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是范畴（category），<MATH_0002>是右乘性的（right multiplicative）系统（system），其态射（morphisms）属于<MATH_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 规则<MATH_0004>及<MATH_0005>定义函子（functor）<MATH_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对于任意<MATH_0007>，态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>中是同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0010>是任意函子（functor），使得<MATH_0011>对于每个<MATH_0012>都可逆（invertible），则存在唯一的函子（functor）<MATH_0013>使得<MATH_0014>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"right multiplicative","target_term":"右乘性的"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"原范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"right multiplicative","target_term":"右乘性的","context":"指定系统的条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统","context":"右乘性系统；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"指定求逆的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"局部化函子及泛性质中的函子；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"指定态射经局部化所得的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"指定态射经局部化后的性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆","context":"泛性质中的求逆条件；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
