{"unit_id":"tag:05Q7:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是范畴（category）。设<MATH_0002>是右乘性的（right multiplicative）系统（system）。若<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的两个态射（morphisms），且\n<MATH_0006>\n是交换图表（commutative diagram），它在<MATH_0007>中，则存在态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>，它在<MATH_0009>中，以及交换图表（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0010>，\n它在<MATH_0011>中，且满足<MATH_0012>及<MATH_0013>、<MATH_0014>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"right multiplicative","target_term":"右乘性的"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图表"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图表"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"给定范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"right multiplicative","target_term":"右乘性的","context":"指定系统的条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统","context":"右乘性系统；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"给定的两个局部化态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图表","context":"原有与构造的图表；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"构造提升图表的态射；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
