{"unit_id":"tag:04VB:prose-0008","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<TEXTBFOPEN_0001>乘性的（Multiplicative）系统（systems）与双侧分式演算（two sided calculus of fractions）。<TEXTBFCLOSE_0001>\n若<MATH_0001>是乘性的（multiplicative）系统（system），则左分式演算（left）和右分式演算（right calculus of fractions）给出的范畴（categories）典范同构（canonically isomorphic）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的"},{"source_term":"systems","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"two sided calculus of fractions","target_term":"双侧分式演算"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"left","target_term":"左分式演算"},{"source_term":"right calculus of fractions","target_term":"右分式演算"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的","context":"标题中系统的乘性条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"systems","target_term":"系统","context":"标题中的态射系统；待决。"},{"source_term":"two sided calculus of fractions","target_term":"双侧分式演算","context":"同时具有左右分式的构造；待决。"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的","context":"给定系统的乘性条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统","context":"给定态射系统；待决。"},{"source_term":"left","target_term":"左分式演算","context":"原文并列省略 calculus of fractions 的左侧名称；待决。"},{"source_term":"right calculus of fractions","target_term":"右分式演算","context":"原文并列右侧的完整名称；待决。"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范同构","context":"两种分式范畴之间的自然指定同构；待决。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"左右分式范畴；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04VL:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是范畴（category），<MATH_0002>是乘性的（multiplicative）系统（system）。左分式（left fractions）的范畴（category）与右分式（right fractions）的范畴（category）<MATH_0003>典范同构（canonically isomorphic）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"left fractions","target_term":"左分式"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"right fractions","target_term":"右分式"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"原范畴及两种分式范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的","context":"给定系统的乘性条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统","context":"指定态射系统；待决。"},{"source_term":"left fractions","target_term":"左分式","context":"左分式构造；待决。"},{"source_term":"right fractions","target_term":"右分式","context":"右分式构造；待决。"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范同构","context":"两构造之间指定的同构；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04VL:proof","translation":"用<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>表示这两个分式（fractions）范畴（categories）。由引理<REF_0001>及<REF_0002>的泛性质（universal properties），得到函子（functors）<MATH_0003>及<MATH_0004>。由泛性质（universal properties）中的唯一性（uniqueness）陈述，这些函子（functors）互为逆（inverse）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fractions","target_term":"分式"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"universal properties","target_term":"泛性质"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"universal properties","target_term":"泛性质"},{"source_term":"uniqueness","target_term":"唯一性"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"左右分式范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"fractions","target_term":"分式","context":"这两个范畴采用的分式构造；待决。"},{"source_term":"universal properties","target_term":"泛性质","context":"两种局部化的泛性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"由泛性质给出的两个函子；待决。"},{"source_term":"uniqueness","target_term":"唯一性","context":"泛性质中函子的唯一性；待决。"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"这两个函子互为逆；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:05Q8:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是范畴（category），<MATH_0002>是乘性的（multiplicative）系统（system）。若除MS1、MS2、MS3外还有以下性质，就称<MATH_0003>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>饱和的（saturated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>MS4<ITEMCLOSE_0001> 给定三个可合成的（composable）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004>，若<MATH_0005>，则<MATH_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0002>\n","allowed_english":["MS1","MS2","MS3","MS4"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的"},{"source_term":"composable","target_term":"可合成的"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"原范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的","context":"给定系统的条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统","context":"指定态射系统；待决。"},{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的","context":"本定义引入的附加性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"composable","target_term":"可合成的","context":"三个态射可合成的条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"饱和条件中的态射；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04VB:prose-0009","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，饱和的（saturated）乘性的（multiplicative）系统（system）包含所有同构（isomorphisms）。此外，若<MATH_0001>是可合成的（composable）态射（morphisms），所在为某个范畴（category），且<MATH_0002>是同构（isomorphisms），则<MATH_0003>是同构（isomorphism）（因为此时<MATH_0004>既有左逆也有右逆（inverse），故可逆（invertible））。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"composable","target_term":"可合成的"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的","context":"系统的饱和性；待决。"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的","context":"系统的乘性条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统","context":"给定乘性系统；待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"系统包含的及复合所得的同构；待决。"},{"source_term":"composable","target_term":"可合成的","context":"给定态射可合成；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"给定三个态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"这些态射所在的范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"由左右逆推出的同构性；待决。"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"原文并列的左、右逆；待决。"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆","context":"同时有左右逆的结论；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:003D:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n现在可见，先前构造的变换（transformations）<MATH_0001>及<MATH_0002>可以恢复为<MATH_0003>及<MATH_0004>。此外，上面得到的所有规则都是下面引理所述性质的推论。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"transformations","target_term":"变换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"transformations","target_term":"变换","context":"先前构造的函子变换；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
